{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20133","headline":"送淡公 六 · 孟郊","name":"送淡公 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师得天文章，所以相知怀。\n数年伊雒同，一旦江湖乖。\n江湖有故庄，小女啼喈喈。\n我忧未相识，乳养难和谐。\n幸以片佛衣，诱之令看斋。\n斋中百福言，催促西归来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}